# SOURCE-ONLY / NOT INSTALLABLE.
# <validated-immutable-fabric-tenant-id> is NOT a valid literal role ID:
# a separate, approved operator must validate an exact canonical TenantID.
# Never replace with a wildcard, slug, browser input or namespace label.
# An installer MUST refuse this unspecialized template.
path "fabric/data/tenants/<validated-immutable-fabric-tenant-id>/*" {
  capabilities = ["read"]
}
# No list on fabric/metadata/tenants/, no sibling path, no auth/token/sys.
